{
  "name": "Lead Responder: Cedar & Slate (demo)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Intake and validation\nThe website form posts here. Every field is checked the same way the page checks it, the browser gets its answer right away, and bots that fill the hidden field are quietly accepted and dropped.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "aa890e55-2194-446e-a7db-4edc8913e940",
      "name": "Note: intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Claude reads the lead\nOnly the service picked, the ZIP code, whether a phone was given, and the message go to Claude. Name, email and phone stay here. If Claude fails, the fallback sends a plain acknowledgement and flags the lead for a person.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d3425366-e9fe-443e-a090-ef84980b9709",
      "name": "Note: claude",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Reply to the customer\nSends the plain-text reply from Dana. Spam gets no reply. If sending fails, the run carries on and the failure is written to the log.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a04acff7-53b0-430f-a082-8e434c8354eb",
      "name": "Note: reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2060,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Alert the team\nHot and warm leads, any lead Claude could not read, and any lead whose reply failed to send go to Slack with a link to the lead log. If Slack is down, the same alert goes to the office by email.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "66a66301-0ba3-4809-ad2e-eff82974f413",
      "name": "Note: alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2720,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Log every lead\nEvery real lead becomes one row in the Google Sheet: score, tier, why, and what was sent.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "aa887cac-5562-463d-a9f2-d12a564aa865",
      "name": "Note: log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3620,
        60
      ]
    },
